  "id": "nsw_planning_doc_071",
  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 9 Newington\n\nClause 9.9.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified Heritage Items within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain distinctly single storey streetscapes that exist within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect groups or runs of buildings which retain their original built form including roof forms, original detailing and finishes.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect significant streetscapes and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - land_use_zoning (land_use_zoning): To preserve the predominantly low density residential character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off-street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.9.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified values of the Petersham South (Norwood Estate) Heritage Conservation Area, Norwood Park Estate Heritage Conservation Area and the Llewellyn Estate Heritage Conservation Area.\n\n",
  "metadata": {
    "document_name": "Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 9 Newington",
    "extractions_count": 8
  }
